OL,3,Vupppppp5CWednesday
OL,5,G2320 The Singing Detective
OL,6,     F4/6. Dennis Potter's classic drama
OL,7,     Fserial with music. Marlow as a
OL,8,     Fchild visits London, but is not
OL,9,     Fimpressed. A film option on
OL,10,     FMarlow's novel thickens the plot.
OL,11,G0030 Secrets of Skin
OL,12,     F1/6. Professor Ben Garrod explores
OL,13,     Fhow versatile the basic skin
OL,14,     Fstructure truly is, revealing how
OL,15,     Fslight adaptations have created
OL,16,     Fbirds' feathers and a rhinoceros's
OL,17,     Fhorn.
OL,18,G0100 Gareth Edwards's Great Welsh
OL,19,G     Adventure
OL,20,     F3/5. It's a scorcher as Gareth
OL,21,     FEdwards and wife Maureen get to
OL,22,     Fthe seaside resort of Llandudno.
